  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>DFT-load_ods_patient_hospital3
Hospital 3 patients: sta.sta_patient_hospital3 -&gt; ods.patient. Run by WF-load_ods, which empties ods.patient first.
1. NUL: the text NULL becomes empty
2. DCNV: ODS names and types
3. DB_DST: insert into ods.patient
Red hops: rows DCNV cannot convert, and rows ods.patient refuses, go to adm.ods_load_reject.</note>
